178,"x":"And heaven and nature sing,"},{"a":18.178,"b":21.928,"x":"And heaven and nature sing,"},{"a":21.928,"b":26.85,"x":"And heaven, and heaven, and nature sing."},{"a":26.85,"b":30.366,"x":"Joy to the earth! the Savior reigns!"},{"a":30.366,"b":33.178,"x":"Let men their songs employ;"},{"a":33.178,"b":35.053,"x":"While fields and floods, rocks, hills and plains"},{"a":35.053,"b":36.928,"x":"Repeat the sounding joy,"},{"a":36.928,"b":40.678,"x":"Repeat the sounding joy,"},{"a":40.678,"b":45.6,"x":"Repeat, repeat, the sounding joy."},{"a":45.6,"b":49.116,"x":"No more let sins and sorrows grow,"},{"a":49.116,"b":51.928,"x":"Nor thorns infest the ground;"},{"a":51.928,"b":53.803,"x":"He comes to make His blessings flow"},{"a":53.803,"b":55.678,"x":"Far as the curse is found,"},{"a":55.678,"b":59.428,"x":"Far as the curse is found,"},{"a":59.428,"b":64.35,"x":"Far as, far as, the curse is found."},{"a":64.35,"b":67.866,"x":"He rules the world with truth and grace,"},{"a":67.866,"b":70.678,"x":"And makes the nations prove"},{"a":70.678,"b":72.553,"x":"The glories of His righteousness,"},{"a":72.553,"b":74.428,"x":"And wonders of His love,"},{"a":74.428,"b":78.178,"x":"And wonders of His love,"},{"a":78.178,"b":83.1,"x":"And wonders, wonders, of His love."}],"lanes":{"KIDS":3},"chords":[[0.6,2,"maj"],[2.475,7,"maj"],[4.35,2,"maj"],[6.225,2,"maj"],[8.1,2,"maj"],[9.0375,7,"maj"],[9.975,9,"maj"],[10.9125,2,"maj"],[11.85,7,"maj"],[12.7875,9,"maj"],[13.725,2,"maj"],[15.6,2,"maj"],[17.475,2,"maj"],[19.35,2,"maj"],[20.2875,9,"maj"],[21.225,9,"maj"],[22.1625,7,"maj"],[23.1,2,"maj"],[24.0375,9,"maj"],[24.975,2,"maj"],[26.85,2,"maj"],[27.7875,7,"maj"],[28.725,9,"maj"],[29.6625,2,"maj"],[30.6,7,"maj"],[31.5375,9,"maj"],[32.475,2,"maj"],[34.35,2,"maj"],[36.225,2,"maj"],[38.1,2,"maj"],[39.0375,9,"maj"],[39.975,9,"maj"],[40.9125,7,"maj"],[41.85,2,"maj"],[42.7875,9,"maj"],[43.725,2,"maj"],[45.6,2,"maj"],[46.5375,7,"maj"],[47.475,9,"maj"],[48.4125,2,"maj"],[49.35,7,"maj"],[50.2875,9,"